# Phase A W2.1 — Modules parent folder
#
# This directory is the parent for all extracted modules. It will be populated
# by W3+ as each module gets extracted from the LankaConnect.* monolith:
#
#   src/Modules/Notifications/      W3 (Week 3)
#   src/Modules/Communications/     W4
#   src/Modules/Media/              W4
#   src/Modules/Money/              W5 (moved up from W9 per architect review)
#   src/Modules/Forms/              W6
#   src/Modules/Payments/           W7
#   src/Modules/Events/             W8-W9 (extended to 3 weeks)
#   src/Modules/Identity/           W10
#
# Each module follows the canonical 5-layer structure:
#   <Module>.Domain.csproj
#   <Module>.Application.csproj
#   <Module>.Infrastructure.csproj
#   <Module>.Web.csproj
#   <Module>.Contracts.csproj (the public ABI other modules consume)
#   <Module>.Tests.csproj (per-module test project)
#
# Per ADR-002 (tenancy strategy) + ADR-005 (Money DTO migration), modules
# communicate via IntegrationEvent contracts published through the
# BuildingBlocks.Contracts dispatcher — NEVER via direct project references.
# ArchTest (landing in W2.2) enforces.
#
# Master TODO: docs/MASTER_TODO_PHASE_A_MODULAR_MONOLITH.md §"Phase A.W3" et seq.
